# CODEOWNERS — maps paths to reviewers who must approve changes.
#
# Files not matched by any pattern below require the default branch
# protection review (currently: any collaborator).
#
# https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings/about-code-owners

# Root-level project metadata — low-risk, single-author files
/README.md                    @shrwnsan
/LICENSE                      @shrwnsan
/CHANGELOG.md                 @shrwnsan
/CONTRIBUTING.md              @shrwnsan

# Documentation — design docs, PRDs, evals, guides
/docs/*.md                    @shrwnsan

# SKILL.md — agent-facing integration doc
/SKILL.md                     @shrwnsan
